{"availability":"available","full":"cjlarose/de-jong","name":"de-jong","description":"ClojureScript de Jong Attractor","category":"Other","language":"Clojure","stars":81,"forks":1,"created":"2015-05-01T06:36:42Z","updated":"2016-11-27T18:01:00Z","branch":"master","homepage":"http://cjlarose.com/de-jong","topics":[],"demo":"http://cjlarose.com/de-jong","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T02:07:25.171Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T02:07:25.171Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T02:07:25.171Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:23.422Z","stars":81,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-11T02:07:25.171Z","stars":81,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The de Jong Attractor is a system parameterized by four reals a, b, c, d ∈ [-π, π). For a given choice of these parameters and an initial point ⟨x0, y0⟩, the attractor yields a sequence of points where each point is defined in terms of the previous: ⟨xn+1, yn+1⟩ = ⟨sin(ayn) - cos(bxn), sin(cxn) - cos(dyn)⟩.","The formula is quite simple, but plots of the de Jong Attractor can be quite beautiful. This project explores this beauty by presenting an interface that animates between plots of the attractor by linear interpolation on the four parameters.","It is implemented in ClojureScript with Om and THREE.js, using custom GLSL vertex shaders for the calculation of points."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cjlarose/de-jong/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"1b13ec2a9903a77bbb5e28380d1df36d6f6ba24c33fe81f3d10ca49b161f0a30","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:23.589Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:23.589Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The de Jong Attractor is a system parameterized by four reals a, b, c, d ∈ [-π, π). For a given choice of these parameters and an initial point ⟨x0, y0⟩, the attractor yields a sequence of points where each point is defined in terms of the previous: ⟨xn+1, yn+1⟩ = ⟨sin(ayn) - cos(bxn), sin(cxn) - cos(dyn)⟩.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cjlarose/de-jong/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"1b13ec2a9903a77bbb5e28380d1df36d6f6ba24c33fe81f3d10ca49b161f0a30","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cjlarose/de-jong/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:23.589Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2016-11-27T18:01:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cjlarose/de-jong/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:23.589Z","hash":"1b13ec2a9903a77bbb5e28380d1df36d6f6ba24c33fe81f3d10ca49b161f0a30","originalBytes":1275,"storedBytes":1275,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["attractor","demo","jong","lein","bourke","cljsbuild","cos","dev","four","n+1","plots","point","quite","sin","three","animates","auto","beautiful","beauty","between","build","calculation","choice","clojurescript","custom","de-jong","de-jong.core","defined","each","explores","figwheel","formula","given","glsl","image","implemented","initial","interface","interpolation","linear","live","once","parameterized","parameters","parameters.","points","points.","presenting","preview","previous","project","reals","repl","require","rlwrap","sequence","shaders","simple","start","system","terms","these","three.js","usage","using","vertex","visit","watch","where","yields"]},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:23.422Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["3D & graphics"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"http://cjlarose.com/de-jong","attemptedAt":"2026-10-08T16:19:28.465Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T16:19:28.465Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-08T16:19:28.465Z","target":"http://cjlarose.com/de-jong/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-15T16:19:28.465Z"},"previewAttemptAt"